==Battleground==
*20 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Satan Claus]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Gorilliam]] spawns.
**5 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Similarly to the original [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 17|Floor 17]], all the enemies are at least part [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]. This floor doesn't really change all that much, just replacing the [[Elder Sloth]] with Satan Claus, and [[Nimoy Bore]] with Gorilliam, and  buffing the peons. [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|Anti Alien]] units are all useful here, particularly [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]], due to its strong ability against aliens and comes with [[:Category:Cats with Warp Immunity|Warp Immunity]], which is pretty important due to 2 of the major enemies being able to warp cats. You can also bring [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti Floatings]] if you're having trouble with Bun Bun Symbiote.

